  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Texture class manages the complete lifecycle of 2D textures within a WebGL rendering environment. It encapsulates loading image data via a ResourceLoader, creating the underlying WebGLTexture on the GPU, and handling parameter configuration (filtering, wrapping). It supports asynchronous loading, dynamic pixel updates via setPixels, and serialization/deserialization for persistence."
  },
